rles-iii-prince-of-monaco.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Charles III, Prince of Monaco</span><span class="tp">1818–1889</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ferdinand-i-of-bulgaria"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ferdinand-i-of-bulgaria.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ferdinand I of Bulgaria</span><span class="tp">1861–1948</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/john-vorster"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/john-vorster.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">John Vorster</span><span class="tp">1915–1983</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
